  <item>
    <title>名校机械、地质、环境硕博学长学姐教你填志愿：如何选到最不后悔的专业</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66800bc55c33fe90f5af45d7</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66800bc55c33fe90f5af45d7</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 29 Jun 2024 13:27:31 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>在本期节目中，机械领域博士学姐将分享力学专业的学业难度、就业情况，以及对女生学工科的看法；地质领域、环境领域学长学姐将分享他们的转行之路。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="23">00:23</a>：介绍4位嘉宾背景和专业领域。</span></p><span></span><p><span>中国科学技术大学力学博士小a学姐分享</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="100">01:40</a>：专业选择动机：爱国情怀及擅长物理</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="126">02:06</a>：女性在机械专业中的地位和挑战。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="292">04:52</a>：力学就业生产线环境中工作的挑战</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="413">06:53</a>：力学专业课程设置与学习经历</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="580">09:40</a>：选择继续读硕士和博士的原因</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="809">13:29</a>：机械专业就业前景</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="915">15:15</a>：关于优先选择学校还是专业的看法</span></p><span></span><p><span>同济大学海洋地质硕士Nicky学长分享</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1029">17:09</a>：分享自己的教育背景和职业</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1075">17:55</a>：专业选择的偶然性:滑档才去了这个当时根本不了解的专业</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1314">21:54</a>：通过不同渠道探索专业前景</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1527">25:27</a>：个人职业规划的转变和实习经历。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1788">29:48</a>：转行的3个关键能力</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1852">30:52</a>：对于本科生不满意所选专业的建议</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2252">37:32</a>：优先选学校还是专业?-无脑专业</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2307">38:27</a>：推荐专业：当前就业市场上有需求，如设计、数学、计算机等</span></p><span></span><p><span>华南理工环境专业硕士CC学姐分享</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2915">48:35</a>：环境专业毕业生的就业方向和行业现状</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3141">52:21</a>：专业选择的反思：别太草率</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3259">54:19</a>：专业选择的误区和一些可实操的中肯建议：关注缺点，通过实践了解</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3437">57:17</a>：环境专业课程与学习建议</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3721">01:02:01</a>：毕业后选择科研or社会工作，两者间的选择与权衡</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3871">01:04:31</a>：实习经历与职业探索：研一开始做HR实习生</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4127">01:08:47</a>：从HR转为产品经理，职业转变与个人成长</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4210">01:10:10</a>： 研究生学习与实习机会</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4265">01:11:05</a>：播客总结与下期预告</span></p>]]></description>
