  <item>
    <title>打工人的自我救赎计划：用行动打败焦虑，用成长治愈迷茫</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6672474ab6a8412729c5bf64</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6672474ab6a8412729c5bf64</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 19 Jun 2024 02:49:46 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期播客的主题：工作后的心态变化、收获与成长。段段将分享她裸辞后的感受，崔崔将分享如何在清闲的工作环境中达到自洽。</span></p><span></span><h3><strong><span>工作经历和感受</span></strong></h3><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span>&nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="68">01:08</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="123">02:03</a></span></strong><span>：介绍目前工作，讨论外企与互联网公司的工作环境差异。</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span>&nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="151">02:31</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="233">03:53</a></span></strong><span>：讨论工作时间、加班文化和工作生活平衡。</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><h3><strong><span>管培生制度讨论</span></strong></h3><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span>&nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="367">06:07</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="475">07:55</a></span></strong><span>：分享管培生经历，讨论公司培养制度的优缺点。</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span>&nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="526">08:46</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="620">10:20</a></span></strong><span>：讨论轮岗制度的利弊，以及个人职业发展。</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><h3><strong><span>工作选择和职业规划</span></strong></h3><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span>&nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="655">10:55</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="767">12:47</a></span></strong><span>：提醒听众在选择管培生岗位时要做足功课，考虑公司规模和稳定性。</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span>&nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="774">12:54</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="819">13:39</a></span></strong><span>：分享日常工作内容，讨论工作满意度和状态。</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><h3><strong><span>工作与个人成长</span></strong></h3><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span>&nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="882">14:42</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="999">16:39</a></span></strong><span>：讨论工作忙碌与清闲时的不同心理状态，以及如何找到平衡。</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span>&nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1034">17:14</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1102">18:22</a></span></strong><span>：分享个人如何通过规划和行动改善工作和生活状态。</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><h3><strong><span>裸辞经历和反思</span></strong></h3><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span>&nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1200">20:00</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1290">21:30</a></span></strong><span>：段段分享裸辞后的感受和重新找工作的困难。</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span>&nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1356">22:36</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1532">25:32</a></span></strong><span>：讨论冲动决定的后果，以及如何更理性地分析和决策。</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><h3><strong><span>自我成长和副业探索</span></strong></h3><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1576">26:16</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1734">28:54</a></span></strong><span>：分享自我成长的方法，如阅读和运动，以及副业探索的考虑因素。</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span>&nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1783">29:43</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1908">31:48</a></span></strong><span>：讨论网络信息的影响，以及如何避免冲动行为。</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><h3><strong><span>健康和精神层面的重视</span></strong></h3><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span>&nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1932">32:12</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2024">33:44</a></span></strong><span>：讨论健康、饮食和精神层面的关注，以及如何通过具体行动减少焦虑。</span></li><span></span></ul>]]></description>
