  <item>
    <title>两位985天坑专业女硕士实习、转行、秋招血泪史，有亿点点启发</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6669aae1b6a84127294964fc</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6669aae1b6a84127294964fc</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 12 Jun 2024 14:04:17 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期是我们的第一期播客，讲述了段段和floria两个人从学校到社会的转变阶段，如何做职业规划，找实习，在秋招中斩获offer。迷茫、困难我们都有遇到过，关于我们是如何一步一步战胜；在我们的视角中同龄人是什么样子的；以及我们认为哪些因素造就了我们所遇到的局面，再来一次，会有哪些建议，都在这一期啦！</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期内容</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="59">00:59</a>关于这个播客</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="78">01:18</a>毕业之后的生活非常有挑战</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="210">03:30</a>本期播客主题：毕业找工作经历</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="237">03:57</a>段段：从大三开始职业规划，一路兜兜转转</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="406">06:46</a>石油勘探专业毕业去向</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="471">07:51</a>去欧莱雅市场部的学弟</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="599">09:59</a>floria：本科的时候没想过实习</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="709">11:49</a>读书时那些发展爱好和事业的同龄人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="754">12:34</a>学生干部经历对去私企和考公有不同的作用</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="902">15:02</a>尽早思考和确定目标会更好</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1094">18:14</a>学校系统中“功利性”挣学分、综测的我们</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1186">19:46</a>理工科硕士实验与实习的兼顾</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1377">22:57</a>floria：后知后觉的秋招预备战</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1540">25:40</a>秋招开始时找到第一份实习</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1735">28:55</a>23年的秋招是地狱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1938">32:18</a>段段：11月才拿到一个不满意的offer</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2070">34:30</a>天坑专业转行的痛</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2484">41:24</a>秋招是个持久战</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2582">43:02</a>给学弟学妹们的转行建议：选专业、跨考考研、早做技能准备、早实习</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3200">53:20</a>明确方向最重要但不要花太久，大方向对然后走一步看一步</span></p><span></span><p><span>第一期录制，有许多不足之处，欢迎大家给我们提建议。</span></p>]]></description>
